\ node/wmsg_vectors.fam — tabminer's values for node/wmsg.fam (docs/ONION.md,
\ init mode; docs/GUI_WALLET.md, phase 3).  Written by
\ miner/src/fam_msg_vectors.rs (`cargo test --release --features dev --lib
\ write_fam_msg_vectors -- --ignored`); not to be edited.  Read by
\ node/wmsg_test.fam.
\
\ Two participants, A and B: Dilithium seeds at mxsa, mxsb; Kyber seeds
\ (d, z) at mxda mxza, mxdb mxzb.  mxseq, mxexp, mxnon (8 bytes each):
\ A's session announce (nonce mxnon) hashes (SHAKE256-256) to mxha, its
\ object (tag 1) has the id mxia; the carried announces (nonce 0) of A
\ and B hash to mxhca, mxhcb.  A's payload to B: kind 1, the inner bytes
\ byte j 5j+3 (mxil of them), the encapsulation's randomness mxm, the
\ nonce mxn: its object is mxol bytes, hashing to mxho, its id mxio.
\ mxnow: a time before expiry.  mxrn ( -- n )  the rendezvous cases;
\ mxr ( i -- )  case i: the id at mxid, the epoch mxe, the nodes mxnn,
\ the indexes at mxix (mxk of them).

: mxp variable ;  : mxsa variable ;  : mxsb variable ;  : mxda variable ;  : mxza variable ;
: mxdb variable ;  : mxzb variable ;  : mxseq variable ;  : mxexp variable ;  : mxnon variable ;
: mxha variable ;  : mxia variable ;  : mxhca variable ;  : mxhcb variable ;  : mxil variable ;
: mxm variable ;  : mxn variable ;  : mxol variable ;  : mxho variable ;  : mxio variable ;
: mxnow variable ;  : mxid variable ;  : mxe variable ;  : mxnn variable ;  : mxix variable ;  : mxk variable ;
: mxc  mxp @ c!  mxp @ 1 lit + mxp ! ;
: mxbufs
mxsa @ 0= if
	20 lit alloc mxsa !  20 lit alloc mxsb !  20 lit alloc mxda !  20 lit alloc mxza !  20 lit alloc mxdb !
	20 lit alloc mxzb !  8 lit alloc mxseq !  8 lit alloc mxexp !  8 lit alloc mxnon !  20 lit alloc mxha !
	20 lit alloc mxia !  20 lit alloc mxhca !  20 lit alloc mxhcb !  20 lit alloc mxm !  C lit alloc mxn !
	20 lit alloc mxho !  20 lit alloc mxio !  20 lit alloc mxid !  10 lit alloc mxix !
then ;

